ry"><a href="#/staff" class="nav__link"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"></circle><path d="M5 20c.6-3.6 3.4-5.5 7-5.5s6.4 1.9 7 5.5"></path></svg><span>Xodimlar</span></a></li><li class="nav__item nav__item--secondary"><a href="#/activity" class="nav__link"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 7h11M9 12h11M9 17h11M4.5 7h.3M4.5 12h.3M4.5 17h.3"></path></svg><span>Amallar jurnali</span></a></li><li class="nav__item nav__item--secondary"><a href="#/subscription" class="nav__link"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="13" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18M16 15h2"></path></svg><span>Obuna</span></a></li><li class="nav__item nav__item--secondary"><a href="#/shop-settings" class="nav__link" aria-current="page"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h2M10 17h10"></path><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="17" r="2"></circle></svg><span>Do'kon sozlamalari</span></a></li><li class="nav__item nav__item--more"><a href="#/more" class="nav__link"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.2"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.2"></circle></svg><span>Yana</span></a></li></ul></nav><main class="shell__main" tabindex="-1"><h1 class="shell__title">Do'kon sozlamalari</h1><form class="form" novalidate=""><div class="field"><label for="settings-name">Do'kon nomi</label><input id="settings-name" class="input" autocomplete="off" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="settings-name-error" value="Baraka savdo"></div><div class="field"><label for="settings-lang">Do'kon tili</label><select id="settings-lang" class="input"><option value="uz" lang="uz">O'zbekcha</option><option value="ru" lang="ru">Русский</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="settings-days">Odatdagi to'lash muddati, kun</label><input id="settings-days" class="input" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="settings-days-error" value="30"></div><p class="actions"><button type="submit" class="button button--primary">Saqlash</button></p></form><section aria-labelledby="credit-settings-title"><h2 id="credit-settings-title">Nasiya sozlamalari</h2><form class="form" novalidate="" aria-label="Nasiya sozlamalari"><div class="field"><label for="credit-default">Do'konning umumiy limiti, so'm</label><input id="credit-default" class="input input--amount" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="credit-default-error credit-default-hint" value=""><p class="field__hint" id="credit-default-hint">O'z limiti belgilanmagan har bir mijozga qo'llanadi. Bo'sh qoldirilsa, umumiy limit bo'lmaydi.</p></div><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox"><span>Sotuvchilar limitdan oshirib nasiya yoza oladi (ogohlantirish bilan)</span></label><p class="actions"><button type="submit" class="button button--primary">Nasiya sozlamalarini saqlash</button></p></form></section><section aria-labelledby="support-title"><h2 id="support-title">Yordam uchun kirish</h2><p>Platforma administratori muammoni hal qilish uchun do'kon mijozlari va yozuvlarini vaqtincha, faqat o'qish uchun ko'ra oladi. U sabab ko'rsatadi, kirish ko'pi bilan 24 soat davom etadi va har bir ko'rishi faoliyat jurnaliga yoziladi. Kirishni istalgan payt tugatishingiz mumkin.</p><p>Hozir hech bir administrator do'kon ma'lumotlarini ko'ra olmaydi.</p><h3>Kirishlar tarixi</h3><div class="empty"><span class="empty__icon"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 7h11M9 12h11M9 17h11M4.5 7h.3M4.5 12h.3M4.5 17h.3"></path></svg></span><p class="empty__text">Administratorlar bu do'konga hali kirmagan.</p></div></section></main></div>"`;

