y"><a href="#/staff" class="nav__link"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"></circle><path d="M5 20c.6-3.6 3.4-5.5 7-5.5s6.4 1.9 7 5.5"></path></svg><span>Xodimlar</span></a></li><li class="nav__item nav__item--secondary"><a href="#/activity" class="nav__link"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 7h11M9 12h11M9 17h11M4.5 7h.3M4.5 12h.3M4.5 17h.3"></path></svg><span>Amallar jurnali</span></a></li><li class="nav__item nav__item--secondary"><a href="#/subscription" class="nav__link" aria-current="page"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="13" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18M16 15h2"></path></svg><span>Obuna</span></a></li><li class="nav__item nav__item--secondary"><a href="#/shop-settings" class="nav__link"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h2M10 17h10"></path><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="17" r="2"></circle></svg><span>Do'kon sozlamalari</span></a></li><li class="nav__item nav__item--more"><a href="#/more" class="nav__link"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1.2"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.2"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1.2"></circle></svg><span>Yana</span></a></li></ul></nav><main class="shell__main" tabindex="-1"><h1 class="shell__title">Obuna</h1><dl class="facts"><dt>Holat</dt><dd>Sinov muddati</dd><dt>Muddat tugaydi</dt><dd>2026-yil 26-oktabr<span class="facts__note">20 kun qoldi</span></dd><dt>Narxi</dt><dd>oyiga 100&nbsp;000 so'm</dd></dl><section aria-labelledby="subscription-card-title"><h2 id="subscription-card-title">To'lov uchun karta</h2><p class="row__name">Humo · Anorbank</p><p class="startcode__text">8600 1234 5678 9012</p><p class="actions"><button type="button" class="button" aria-label="Nusxalash: Humo · Anorbank">Nusxalash</button><span class="visually-hidden" role="status"></span></p><p class="hint">To'lovdan keyin chekni Telegramdagi do'kon botiga /obuna buyrug'i orqali yuboring.</p></section><section aria-labelledby="receipts-title"><h2 id="receipts-title">Chek yuborish</h2><p>To'lovni yuqoridagi kartaga o'tkazgach, chekni shu yerda yuboring. Administrator ko'rib chiqqach, obuna muddati uzaytiriladi.</p><form class="form" novalidate="" aria-label="Chek yuborish"><div class="field"><label for="receipt-months">Necha oy uchun to'ladingiz</label><input id="receipt-months" class="input" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" maxlength="4" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="receipt-months-hint receipt-months-error" value="1"><p class="field__hint" id="receipt-months-hint">1 dan 36 gacha.</p></div><div class="field"><label for="receipt-amount">O'tkazilgan summa</label><input id="receipt-amount" class="input input--amount" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="receipt-amount-hint receipt-amount-error" value="100000"><p class="field__hint" id="receipt-amount-hint">Narx bo'yicha hisoblangan: 1 oy uchun 100&nbsp;000 so'm. Boshqa summa o'tkazgan bo'lsangiz, o'zgartiring.</p></div><div class="field"><label for="receipt-file">Chek</label><input id="receipt-file" class="input" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,application/pdf" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="receipt-file-hint receipt-file-error" type="file"><p class="field__hint" id="receipt-file-hint">JPEG, PNG yoki WebP rasm, yoki PDF; 5 MB gacha.</p></div><p class="hint">Karta: Humo · Anorbank ··9012</p><p class="actions"><button type="submit" class="button button--primary">Chekni yuborish</button></p></form></section><section aria-labelledby="receipts-history"><h2 id="receipts-history">Yuborilgan cheklar</h2><div class="empty"><span class="empty__icon"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 7h11M9 12h11M9 17h11M4.5 7h.3M4.5 12h.3M4.5 17h.3"></path></svg></span><p class="empty__text">Hali chek yuborilmagan.</p></div></section><section aria-labelledby="subscription-limited-title"><h2 id="subscription-limited-title">Cheklangan rejim</h2><p>Muddat tugagach do'kon cheklangan rejimga o'tadi: yangi nasiya yozilmaydi. To'lov qabul qilish, qarzlarni ko'rish va eslatmalar ishlayveradi.</p></section></main></div>"`;

